Package: arbtt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Automatic Rule-Based Time Tracker
 arbtt records active window titles and related desktop activity over time.
 It includes tools to capture logs and derive statistics from customizable
 categorization rules.
